HEADER;
/*
  Component:  Bearing 608
  Standard:   ISO 15 boundary dimensions; simplified internal geometry
  Family:     radial ball bearing (simplified envelope)
  Size:       608
  Data source: Boundary dimensions from common ISO 15 / catalogue tables; internal rings, balls, and chamfers are parametric, not catalogue geometry. See components/DATA_SOURCES.md.
  Notes:      Outer and inner rings plus spherical balls (analytic sphere surfaces). Rings are plain tubes at Simplified detail and carry an engineering-default edge chamfer at Detailed and above. Seals and cages are omitted.
  Features modeled:      outer-ring, inner-ring, ball-sphere, ring-edge-chamfer
  Features approximated: outer-ring-boundary (PolylineArc, deviation 0.013249981743103545 mm, control circle_segments=64); inner-ring-bore (PolylineArc, deviation 0.00481817517931038 mm, control circle_segments=64)
  Features omitted:      seal (seals are not modelled in this envelope); cage (rolling-element cages are not modelled); race-groove (rolling-element race grooves are not modelled); bore-chamfer (the bore and outer edges are not chamfered at Simplified detail)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
FILE_DESCRIPTION(('Bearing 608'),'2;1');
